# The sample access variation point attaches to the HTTP example: it adds its
# project (src/Access with its tests), the marks in Shared, and the HTTP
# middleware, and changes only the composition root, the projects that
# reference them, the command it marks, and the readme and Makefile.
base library/architecture/dotnet/vp-http-api-in-dotnet.skill/examples
change src/App/App.Host/Program.cs
change src/App/App.Host/App.Host.csproj
change src/Modules/Todo/Todo.Commands/Todo.Commands.csproj
change src/Modules/Todo/Todo.Commands/PlanItemsCommand.cs
change Todo.slnx
change Makefile
change README.md
